WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Rock Paper Scissors: click a hand (rock, paper or scissors) to play against the computer.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
"reset score" sets wins, loses and draw back to 0.

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Click rock: if the computer picks the same hand, it shows "draw" and the draw count goes up by 1.

4
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.000
The computer's hand beats yours: it shows "you lose" and loses goes up by 1.

5
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Your hand beats the computer's: it shows "you won!" and wins goes up by 1.

6
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Click paper and lose again: "you lose", loses is now 3.

7
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Win a few rounds in a row: each "you won!" adds 1 to wins, which climbs to 4.

8
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Same hand as the computer again: "draw", and draw goes up to 2.

9
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Two losses in a row: loses goes from 3 up to 5.

10
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Two more draws: the draw count reaches 4.

11
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Another "you lose" brings loses to 6.

12
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Every click shows the result and updates the score line. Click "reset score" any time to start over.
